'' A HEADER NOTHING PUBLIC NAMES DOES NOT TRAVEL (RFC-0004 §3; T91). onetu includes one.bi,
'' a header-only library for one unit whose member is not private, and exposes nothing
'' from it. Its interface used to include every header the module included, so main
'' compiled one.bi too and the link refused Counter.Bump, defined twice.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 -i tests/modules/src/onetu/libs tests/modules/src/onetu/app/main.bas -o tests/modules/ifaceunneeded.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' ENV: TIKO_INCLUDE=toolchains/tiko-windows/inc
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/modules/ifaceunneeded.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  2
